INT. FOOD TRUCK - NIGHT

Grill hissing. Kim flips a patty, eyes on the window.

Her phone BUZZES on the counter. She puts it on speaker.

KIM
Where are you?

KIP (V.O.)
Two minutes out. Is he there?

KIM
Black sedan. Same spot. Engine running.

KIP (V.O.)
Don't look at him.

KIM
I'm not looking.

She looks. Quick. Back to the grill.

KIP (V.O.)
Kim.

KIM
I know.

KIP (V.O.)
Hand me the bag when I knock. Don't say a word.

KIM
You said the bag was clean.

KIP (V.O.)
It is.

A beat. The sedan's door OPENS.

KIM
Kip. He's walking over.

KIP (V.O.)
Stall him.

Kim wipes her hands. Smiles. Slides the window open.

KIM
What can I get you?
